    </node>
    <node id="袁冠南">
      <data key="d0">袁冠南</data>
      <data key="d1">人物</data>
      <data key="d2">袁冠南 is a young scholar and martial artist, characterized by his handsome appearance and scholarly demeanor. He is notably skilled in combat, employing unconventional weapons such as a writing brush and an inkwell. His primary antagonist is卓天雄, whom he actively engages in battle and evades pursuit from. A significant event in his narrative involves the争夺 of the鸳鸯双刀 (Mandarin Duck Sabers), during which he sustains an injury to his left leg.

His personal life is deeply intertwined with萧中慧, to whom he becomes betrothed. Together, they learn and master the夫妻刀法 (Husband and Wife Saber Technique), which they use in tandem to confront卓天雄. This partnership highlights both their martial synergy and emotional bond. Furthermore,袁冠南 is revealed to be the son of袁夫人, leading to a familial reunion. He is portrayed as a caring and devoted young man, concerned for萧中慧's well-being, and is also referred to as a公子爷 (young master) who has acquired formidable martial skills.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3a280bc0037bf8810ef869f28072c0fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4113f95e5f082a0315358bdf5af6637c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3394ed148cdddca4307d9824a1c13c0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32f6b35d7c1b17ad3c17434ffbeb5dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1335384b66ee37afc8701e4820a3e980&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-635154b96af9206264f68bde6832772c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aebe992daba05e1d9f12616214d70c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37ad2bfe6a11bebefac0853042fc6544&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aff8330803938c1b2899d312f35628dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed3d0128804d3e005420d33a6d13ce3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aca2e56bea8c78422f652b26f5a438fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20d894e54878536e4af6d96c9a33bced&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19b2a43f08ffa1730c1ff0587e2ac18c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7761ca8ce14dfd94808e217ac5f8fec3</data>
