    <node id="萧半和">
      <data key="d0">萧半和</data>
      <data key="d1">人物</data>
      <data key="d2">萧半和, also known as Xiao Yi, is a prominent figure in the jianghu (martial world) recognized as the "Jinyang Great Hero" (晋阳大侠). He is the father of Xiao Zhonghui (萧中慧) and the master of Xiao Manor. His fiftieth birthday celebration is a significant event, where he hosts a grand feast and announces his daughter's engagement.

Beneath his public persona as a respected hero lies a complex and hidden identity. His real name is Xiao Yi (萧义), and he is a eunuch who, sixteen years prior, rescued the Yuan and Yang families. He adopted the alias "Banhe" (半和) and has been living in disguise ever since. He is a practitioner of the Hunyuan Qi (混元炁) martial art and harbors a deep-seated enmity towards Zhuo Tianxiong (卓天雄). His ultimate, secret objective is to assassinate the emperor, positioning him as a rebel against the imperial throne.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3394ed148cdddca4307d9824a1c13c0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32f6b35d7c1b17ad3c17434ffbeb5dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1335384b66ee37afc8701e4820a3e980&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-635154b96af9206264f68bde6832772c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aebe992daba05e1d9f12616214d70c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37ad2bfe6a11bebefac0853042fc6544&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aff8330803938c1b2899d312f35628dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d360b229c6c13e9429e3c9a9b3aa20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aca2e56bea8c78422f652b26f5a438fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b85660e25caa10c95114ba1166e61ad9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cddc26e2632d3734c193d74fef9c656</data>
