    <node id="逍遥子">
      <data key="d0">逍遥子</data>
      <data key="d1">人物</data>
      <data key="d2">逍遥子, also known as 烟霞神龙逍遥子, is a member of the group known as the 太岳四侠 (the Four Great Heroes of Taiyue). He is consistently identified as the eldest brother of this group. His primary weapon is a dry tobacco pipe (旱烟管), which he uses for combat, and he is also skilled in employing hidden weapons (暗器). His martial arts techniques include the use of the pipe for acupoint striking (点穴) and he practices the techniques of the Judge's Brush (判官笔招数).

In a specific incident, 逍遥子, as one of the 太岳四侠, was involved in a conflict with a young woman. Despite the confrontation, he later praised her for being generous and forthright (慷慨豪爽). He is described as a skilled expert (高手) and, at one point, was noted to have sustained an injury to his shoulder.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ef38f0c43a78b9020303dd31c53e4f17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35e7ac1a71641d8b0f2586a1f0e4e66c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-368d40091e149ee22dff5e1fd97b64a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aebe992daba05e1d9f12616214d70c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0078b32fb35e0483ce985f6be3583020&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d360b229c6c13e9429e3c9a9b3aa20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-872ec2da087ebff79b1eb2ae8ee1970b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b85660e25caa10c95114ba1166e61ad9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abc62bee742fe92b0a19092eb807898f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5003b73156eb85d8a9f59ea76f1d5d4e</data>
