    <node id="鸳鸯刀">
      <data key="d0">鸳鸯刀</data>
      <data key="d1">兵器</data>
      <data key="d2">The 鸳鸯刀 (Yuanyang Dao) is a legendary pair of swords, consisting of one long blade and one short blade, which together are said to conceal a great martial arts secret. It is a priceless treasure, with the long blade specifically noted as an invaluable artifact. According to various accounts, obtaining this pair of swords is rumored to grant the wielder invincibility under heaven.

The swords are central to a narrative involving several key figures. They were entrusted to the escort Zhou Weixin as part of a silver shipment, and he was acutely aware of their critical importance, believing they must not be lost. The swords have a historical connection to Xiao Banhe and were later obtained by Liu Yuyi. Ultimately, the pair was seized by Zhuo Tianxiong.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e39d6adc7a5461089ad8d5d04a3b77b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f88ae78f3685a0723a49d80d0d9a5873&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-635154b96af9206264f68bde6832772c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab2132cdefdaed63a4226d401ab2e9a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37ad2bfe6a11bebefac0853042fc6544&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d459cf4cb883a4446fd05607fa4651f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0078b32fb35e0483ce985f6be3583020&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-872ec2da087ebff79b1eb2ae8ee1970b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aca2e56bea8c78422f652b26f5a438fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b85660e25caa10c95114ba1166e61ad9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cddc26e2632d3734c193d74fef9c656</data>
